p-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-93bxxm-55cc6ba69ca6e6ba9557c6bde112f1d4 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-14  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Emballage<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7\">\n#top .hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-8vz72i-4591fb7f6513e2fed5b15f92cc3251a7 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-15  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-8gqcky-ac4fc8f8eb40153648667fd2f2312670 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Nous produisons des emballages en poly\u00e9thyl\u00e8ne haute pression en utilisant la technologie de l\u2019extrusion-soufflage. Nous produisons des emballages en PEHD pour nos propres besoins et nous les proposons \u00e0 la vente. Nous produisons des emballages de 0,5L, 1L, 4L, 5L, 7L, 10L, 20L.<\/p>\n<p>Des machines ultramodernes et un personnel qualifi\u00e9 dot\u00e9 d\u2019une grande exp\u00e9rience garantissent la plus haute qualit\u00e9 des emballages produits. Nous offrons \u00e0 nos clients la possibilit\u00e9 de choisir la couleur de l\u2019emballage ainsi que la personnalisation dans le domaine de la marque priv\u00e9e. Nous pouvons \u00e9galement produire des emballages estamp\u00e9s avec le logo ou le nom de l\u2019entreprise du client.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div><\/p>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0\">\n.flex_column.av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-aerdae-036e9fe60b5057638ce54101670c70b0 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-17  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg90e6w-2eb81602dfa99cb6ba73c2a73ba86905 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-18  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Conditionnement<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba\">\n#top .hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-97fvba-cfa9c6e567ff88280ef095df6dd27fba hr-custom  avia-builder-el-19  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg90ou3-15b1744a7974424a9a302f50ee91c78d '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Le conditionnement et l\u2019emballage de nos produits se font sur des lignes de remplissage et d\u2019emballage modernes, automatis\u00e9es et robotis\u00e9es. Nous disposons de trois lignes de remplissage et d\u2019emballage enti\u00e8rement automatiques et de grande capacit\u00e9, ainsi que de trois lignes semi-automatiques. Le personnel s\u2019engage \u00e0 veiller \u00e0 ce que nos produits soient emball\u00e9s de mani\u00e8re esth\u00e9tique, durable et bien \u00e9tiquet\u00e9e.<\/p>\n<p>Les produits qui quittent notre usine sont s\u00e9curis\u00e9s par une fermeture \u00e0 induction. L\u2019ensemble des op\u00e9rations de production est supervis\u00e9 par un programme informatique PGPS (syst\u00e8me de gestion de la production).<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e\">\n.flex_column.av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-6x6u3a-70185925ab1605c0ac096fde76fa716e av_one_half  avia-builder-el-21  el_after_av_one_half  el_before_av_one_half  first flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg919jt-65ea99b54bdbfb267e5118b218fe8520 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-22  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Blendhouse<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0\">\n#top .hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-5moo12-de410cde88bc16a3984cb8d7170bb2f0 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-23  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg91v0k-bcaf76031651a632c37fab3e63912be6 '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>La production d\u2019huile a lieu dans une usine de m\u00e9lange moderne et informatis\u00e9e, \u00e9quip\u00e9e de sept m\u00e9langeurs avec des syst\u00e8mes de chauffage, de dosage et de filtration.<\/p>\n<p>La mise en lots des mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res pour la production et le transfert des produits finis depuis l\u2019usine de m\u00e9lange s\u2019effectuent via le syst\u00e8me PIGING. Le syst\u00e8me PIGING est bas\u00e9 sur des pistons situ\u00e9s \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du pipeline et actionn\u00e9s par de l\u2019air comprim\u00e9.<\/p>\n<p>Il garantit la reproductibilit\u00e9 de la production et sa propret\u00e9 car les canalisations \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur sont vid\u00e9es et nettoy\u00e9es apr\u00e8s chaque op\u00e9ration. Cela nous permet de nous assurer de la pr\u00e9cision du pesage des mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res et d\u2019\u00e9viter que des produits diff\u00e9rents ne se m\u00e9langent. L\u2019ensemble du processus de m\u00e9lange est contr\u00f4l\u00e9 par un personnel qualifi\u00e9.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084\">\n.flex_column.av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084{\nborder-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;\npadding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='flex_column av-42zzti-e7264b2bbdc095bd0fd54145835c3084 av_one_half  avia-builder-el-25  el_after_av_one_half  avia-builder-el-last  flex_column_div av-zero-column-padding  column-top-margin'     ><p>\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512\">\n#top .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512{\npadding-bottom:20px;\nfont-size:40px;\n}\nbody .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 .av-special-heading-tag .heading-char{\nfont-size:25px;\n}\n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:40px;\n}\n.av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 .av-subheading{\nfont-size:15px;\n}\n\n@media only screen and (min-width: 480px) and (max-width: 767px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n\n@media only screen and (max-width: 479px){ \n#top #wrap_all .av-special-heading.av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 .av-special-heading-tag{\nfont-size:0.8em;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='av-special-heading av-lyg92c79-83412428b3d6dc9b637379aaca279512 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote  avia-builder-el-26  el_before_av_hr  avia-builder-el-first  av-inherit-size'><h2 class='av-special-heading-tag '  itemprop=\"headline\"  >Entrep\u00f4t<\/h2><div class=\"special-heading-border\"><div class=\"special-heading-inner-border\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><br \/>\n\n<style type=\"text\/css\" data-created_by=\"avia_inline_auto\" id=\"style-css-av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393\">\n#top .hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393{\nmargin-bottom:10px;\n}\n.hr.av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 .hr-inner{\nwidth:50px;\nborder-color:#ed1c24;\n}\n<\/style>\n<div  class='hr av-31egyu-6f514170fdfc52417e6422db57280393 hr-custom  avia-builder-el-27  el_after_av_heading  el_before_av_textblock  hr-left hr-icon-no'><span class='hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat'><span class=\"hr-inner-style\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><br \/>\n<section  class='av_textblock_section av-lyg92ooy-1a5e556eccbdbd40585a0e4d2f43e22f '   itemscope=\"itemscope\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/CreativeWork\" ><div class='avia_textblock'  itemprop=\"text\" ><p>Nous disposons de plusieurs entrep\u00f4ts d\u2019une capacit\u00e9 totale de 4 500 emplacements de palettes. Divers syst\u00e8mes ont \u00e9t\u00e9 utilis\u00e9s dans les diff\u00e9rentes sections de l\u2019entrep\u00f4t pour soutenir les processus de l\u2019entrep\u00f4t : Syst\u00e8me de rayonnage \u00e0 accumulation (drive-in rack), syst\u00e8me de rayonnage \u00e0 plate-forme radiocommand\u00e9e (radioshuttle), syst\u00e8me de rayonnage mobile (mooving rack). Tous ces syst\u00e8mes sont associ\u00e9s \u00e0 un programme WMS (syst\u00e8me de gestion d\u2019entrep\u00f4t), qui garantit que les produits sont correctement stock\u00e9s et que leur emplacement est enti\u00e8rement tra\u00e7able.<\/p>\n<p>Nous utilisons des chariots \u00e0 m\u00e2t r\u00e9tractable fiables de STILL, HYSTER et JUNGHEINRICH pour exploiter l\u2019entrep\u00f4t. L\u2019ensemble de la flotte est bas\u00e9 sur l\u2019\u00e9lectromobilit\u00e9, ce qui favorise la protection de l\u2019environnement.<\/p>\n<p>Nous sommes sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans le chargement de conteneurs maritimes, qui n\u00e9cessite des solutions sp\u00e9ciales et une grande pr\u00e9cision dans le processus de mise en place des marchandises dans le conteneur.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/section><\/p><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":4374,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4407","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4407","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4407"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4407\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5632,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4407\/revisions\/5632"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4374"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/venol.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4407"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}